## Commit Message Rule

- **Description:** Commit messages must start with a project ticket (e.g., DB-215), be on one line, and contain no comments.
- **Pattern:** `^([A-Za-z]{2,3}-[0-9]+) [^#\n]+$`
- **Message:** Commit message must start with a ticket ID (e.g., DB-215), be on one line, and have no comments (`#`).
